  jfieldID fid = (*env)->GetFieldID(env, clazz, "nativeCoder", "J");
  (*env)->SetLongField(env, thiz, fid, (jlong) pCoder);
}
{code}
All these functions can fail.  You need to check for, and handle their failures.

